Date: Tue, 10 Feb 2026 07:24:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 09/16] Partial unified parsing implementation (steps 1-6)

Implemented infrastructure for unified parsing of conditional assembly:
- emit() and update_pc() check SKIP_DEPTH to suppress code generation
- capture_label has parse-only mode when skipping
- parse_value uses dummy values for undefined labels when skipping
- Macro directives (.macro/.endmacro) handle skip mode
- process_directive dispatches only conditionals when skipping

Step 7 (removing old skipping code path) is DEFERRED. The old code path
must remain until the unified approach is proven to maintain perfect
synchronization between pass 1 and pass 2. The forward reference
store/replay mechanism requires exact consistency in addressing modes.

Current state: All tests pass, self-assembly succeeds.
